<title>LITHUANIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MARCH 14.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MARCH 14.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for March 14 on Thursday. The litas</p>
<p>is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		    14.03.97     13.03.97</p>
<p>    USD	     4.0000	 4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	     6.4112	 6.3944</p>
<p>    DEM	     2.3618	 2.3410</p>
<p>    ECU	     4.5830	 4.5490</p>
<p>    100JPY	  3.2727	 3.2626</p>
<p>    SEK	     0.5240	 0.5211</p>
<p>    FIM	     0.7915	 0.7842</p>
<p>    EKK	     0.2952	 0.2924</p>
<p>    LAT	     6.8805	 6.8289</p>
<p>    1000RUR	 0.7021	 0.7021</p>
<p>    PLN	     1.3005	 1.2961</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
